# UmmahPulse currently uses the Al Adhan API (api.aladhan.com) for prayer
# times, which is free and requires NO API key. This file is here for
# future use if you ever swap providers or add a proxy.

# Optional: override the prayer-time API base URL without touching code.
# Leave unset to use the default (https://api.aladhan.com).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRAYER_API_BASE=https://api.aladhan.com
